brief:
Singular gathers and synthesizes data from your ad networks, attribution tracker, and other similar sources, which helps you analyze your ROI effectively. DataChannel’s Singular Connector lets you sync data from the Singular API automatically into your data warehouse. This data comes from:

1.  Partner ad networks and agencies, such as campaign cost;
2.  Attribution tracker/MMP, which you can ingest into your BI system and join to network data as needed;
